        <div class="notes" id="notes-7680613" data-guid="7680613"></div>
        <div id="questions-7680613" data-guid="7680613" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7680613_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The licensee shall display his license in a public and conspicuous place at the place where the license shall be applicable so that the same shall always be easily seen and read by any person entering said licensed place for the purpose of purchasing the goods herein authorized to be purchased.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
