<div class="section_content content" id="7680614_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The Mayor of the City of Albany and the Chief of Police are hereby authorized to promulgate rules and regulations not inconsistent with law for the carrying out of the provisions of this article.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
