<div class="section_content content" id="7680616_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">If any provisions of this article or the application thereof to any person or circumstance is held invalid, the validity of the remainder of said article and the application of such article to other persons and circumstances shall not be affected thereby.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
