<div class="section_content content" id="7680619_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">This article shall be known and shall be cited as the "City of Albany Open Container Ordinance."</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7680620 child"
