        <a id="ref7680634-1"
           href="#ft7680634-1"
           class="footnoteref"
        >
          [1]
        </a>
    </span>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7680634" data-guid="7680634"></div>
        <div id="questions-7680634" data-guid="7680634" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7680634_content" title-footnotes="1"><div class="footnotes"><div class="footnote" id="ft7680634-1"><a class="footnoterefnum" href="#ref7680634-1">[1]</a><div class="ftpara">Editor's Note: Former § 105-26, Permits for special events, as amended, was repealed <span class="legref" data-ref="LF2020040"><span class="hisdate">3-4-2024</span> by <span class="loclaw">Ord. No. 77.122.23</span></span>. See now Ch. <a class="xref" guid="45050994" href="45050994#45050994">309</a>, Special Events.</div></div></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7680645 child"
      id="7680645"
      data-guid="7680645"
      data-parent-guid="7680618"
      data-position="2570"
      data-full-title="§ 105-27: Penalties for offenses."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7680645_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7680645_label" for="7680645_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7680645"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 105-27
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7680645"
    >
Penalties for offenses.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7680645" data-guid="7680645"></div>
        <div id="questions-7680645" data-guid="7680645" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7680645_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Any person committing an offense against this article shall be guilty of a violation punishable by a fine not to exceed one hundred fifty dollars ($150.) or by imprisonment for a term not to exceed ten (10) days, or by both such fine and imprisonment, for the first offense, and by a fine not to exceed two hundred fifty dollars ($250.) or imprisonment for a term not to exceed fifteen (15) days, or by both such fine and imprisonment, for a second or subsequent offense.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7680646 child"
      id="7680646"
      data-guid="7680646"
      data-parent-guid="7680618"
      data-position="2571"
      data-full-title="§ 105-28: Presumptive evidence."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7680646_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7680646_label" for="7680646_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7680646"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 105-28
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7680646"
    >
Presumptive evidence.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7680646" data-guid="7680646"></div>
        <div id="questions-7680646" data-guid="7680646" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7680646_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="7680647"><a alt="105-28A" class="litem_number" href="7680647#7680647" onclick="return false;" title="105-28A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">An open bottle or open container in any vehicle shall be presumptive evidence that the same is in possession, with intent to consume, of and by all the occupants thereof, and all are in violation hereof.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7680648"><a alt="105-28B" class="litem_number" href="7680648#7680648" onclick="return false;" title="105-28B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Such presumption does not apply:</div><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="7680649"><a alt="105-28B(1)" class="litem_number" href="7680649#7680649" onclick="return false;" title="105-28B(1)">(1) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">To a duly licensed operator of a vehicle who is at the time operating it for hire in the lawful and proper pursuit of his trade; or</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7680650"><a alt="105-28B(2)" class="litem_number" href="7680650#7680650" onclick="return false;" title="105-28B(2)">(2) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">When the open container is concealed upon the person of one (1) of the occupants.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7680651 child"
      id="7680651"
