  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7680651" data-guid="7680651"></div>
        <div id="questions-7680651" data-guid="7680651" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7680651_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="7680652"><a alt="105-29A" class="litem_number" href="7680652#7680652" onclick="return false;" title="105-29A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Should any section or provision of this article be declared unconstitutional or invalid by the courts, such decision shall not affect the validity of the balance of this article.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7680653"><a alt="105-29B" class="litem_number" href="7680653#7680653" onclick="return false;" title="105-29B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">If any provisions of this article are inconsistent with any federal or state statute, law, rule or regulation, then such statute, law, rule or regulation shall prevail.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
